{{rfd}}
==English==
===Etymology===
Coined from Greek ''[[τετράς]]'' (the number [[four]]).

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''Tetris'''
#{{computing}} an electronic [[game]] in which [[falling]] [[tetromino]]es must be manipulated to form complete lines.

====Quotations====
*'''2005''': Jack Leonard, ''Bad Altitude''
*:''While I worked out a Tetris-like arrangement to get all of the leftovers into the oven, Phil's curiosity got the better of him.''

